  message: "Metrics-block facet: metrics.by_supply_chain_tier omits the derived tier this item's summary block carries (blind-severity-derived priority signal: P3, minor/borderline). metrics.by_supply_chain_tier enumerates 3 tiers (external_dep/first_party/internal_dep) while supply_chain_summary carries a 4th (derived_skipped) and the tier model defines tier-4 derived. The two top-level supply-chain blocks disagree on the tier set, so a consumer iterating by_supply_chain_tier to enumerate all tiers never sees a derived bucket and builds an incomplete tier partition. Folded here per the pass author's recommendation (the derived-tier-shape cluster) rather than a standalone row."  # afb8
